            "notes": "Round 2 we pickup [Back Off](item_cf806fa3-c276-4898-a092-7d7f1a908821), and we start putting our cash into [Ability Power](stat_ability_power). You can't rely on it too much yet, so make sure you're not running too far from your supports.\n\nGet [Rapid Response Radius](item_18720a42-a523-4dbc-9114-891c37a79331) and [Battery Pack](item_5ff8a68c-8f07-4531-9050-5cc5d9128b77). Your field now does damage, is bigger, and lasts longer (contact Blizzard if you experience a biotic field lasting longer than 4 hours)\n\nIf you can afford [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0), it's a great pickup here. Otherwise, pick up some [Ability Power](stat_ability_power).",
