        {
            "id": "13091b6d-7ce1-43fe-80fb-7c810df21eeb",
            "build_id": "6df8c654-4204-474a-bd09-ff38208401f7",
            "round_number": 3,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-23T02:02:03.210936+00:00",
            "notes": "By round 3, it's all coming together.\n\nWith [Track and Field](item_b3750fe4-e416-42b6-ad9e-fe92c7dcffc5) and [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0), we can have nearly 100% [Biotic Field](ability_4e4fa33b-2c32-4b4f-85f8-e186c5ced13d) uptime so long as we keep sprinting. Sprint through the fight until your field runs out, then pop another field and keep sprinting. No need to shoot unless you're far away or finishing someone off. \n\nYou'll also want to use [Helix Rockets](ability_ef3cdff1-48e2-4b69-a51a-bdade1118bdd) for the extra health if you pick up [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0).\n\nIf you're struggling to stay alive: Pick up [Iron Lung](item_22867dc9-50a1-4523-a77a-2fd67b487b51) or [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98). \n\nIf you're surviving and you want to get more kills, go for [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) or [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce).\n\nIf you need to sell [Compression Fatigues](item_a15ed6e6-1f60-4b4c-8f51-ad1ee1140ae3) to afford one of the epic (purple) items, do it.",
